# Everything the build does not need, which is most of it. A fat context is
# slow to send and, worse, makes a stale node_modules or .next reachable from
# inside the build.
node_modules
**/node_modules
.next
**/.next
dist
**/dist
.git
.github
test-results
**/test-results
playwright-report
**/playwright-report
coverage
**/coverage
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.bundle
*.log
docs
.claude
deploy/prometheus/metrics-token
